**Dateiname:** `onroda-logo-transparent.png`  
**Kanonical im Repo:** `artifacts/api-server/assets/onroda-logo-transparent.png`  
**Marketing (Live):** `artifacts/marketing-site/onroda-logo-transparent.png` (Deploy-Kopie für `/var/www/onroda`)

